# Runtime-generated call data — real customer PII (names, phone numbers,
# CNIC numbers), never belongs in git history.
calls/
logs/

# Throwaway debugging artifacts from provider/latency investigations: captured
# audio, per-model probe transcripts, and prompt dumps. Kept out of git because
# they are scratch output of one session, not inputs to the app — and the audio
# and prompt dumps can carry real caller details. Real tests live in tests/.
repro*.txt
repro_messages.json
survey_models*.txt
together_*.txt
together_tools_converted.json
cnic_*.wav
cnic_test*.txt
hello_test.*
agent_script_content.txt
agent_system_prompt.txt
Screenshot*.png
